  "scope": "Complete node-wide leadership observations through bounded batches on the existing host/runtime. Population and initialization fences, exact status identities, one original whole-scan deadline, no publication of partial counts and no timestamp refresh after failure. Cached ages begin before the first batch and remote RPC ages include the full request duration. Automatic balancing remains unimplemented.",
